  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 517.04 Vehicle Purchased from New Hampshire Dealer. No 20 day permit shall be issued to a vehicle purchased or intended to be purchased from a New Hampshire dealer.\n\nSource. #7972, eff 10-17-03 (See Revision Note #1 at chapter heading for Saf-C 500); ss by #9995, INTERIM, eff 9-17-11, EXPIRED: 3-15-12\n\nNew. #10135, eff 5-23-12; ss by #13521, eff 1-13-23 (formerly Saf-C 518.04)",
